.el .ds Aq '
.TH "bead history" 1  "bead history " 
.SH NAME
bead history \- List events for one issue in commit order
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead history\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List one issue\*(Aqs audit events in commit order, including closed issues.
.PP
Each line shows time, actor, kind, revision, and changed fields. \-\-json emits one array. Historical redactions show only the fixed marker, never prior values.
.PP
Use `bead changes` for the workspace\-wide cursor feed, or `bead why \-\-id ID` for the issue\*(Aqs current state and readiness.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output one JSON array
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Issue ID
